@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5174/

### GET All Clients

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients/
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

### GET Client

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients/d8e6b8b2-8fc0-4ac8-b750-2af1779c826a
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

### GET Client with search

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients?search=audi
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

### POST Client

POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "usunezaraz",
  "email": "a@example.com",
  "phone": "500 600 755",
  "nip": "1234567890"
}

### PUT Client

PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients/9000b8fc-2f1f-470c-9fd9-3793f0edbffb
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "usuneteraz",
  "email": "a_new@example.com",
  "phone": "999 888 776",
  "nip": "1234567890"
}

### DELETE Client

DELETE {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients/9000b8fc-2f1f-470c-9fd9-3793f0edbffb
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}


### Creating client with the vehicle
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Anna Nowak (Z autem)",
  "email": "anna@example.com",
  "phone": "987654311",
  "vehicle": {
    "brand": "Audi",
    "model": "A30",
    "licensePlate": "TKI 00000"
  }
}